  "description": "Main Architectural Proposals:\nGround Floor Business Lounge and Meeting Room Suite: The creation of a new business lounge and meeting room suite located directly behind the main reception area.\n\nBasement Building Management Suite: The creation of a new building management suite formed entirely within the existing basement accommodation.\n\nSpecific Works & Design Interventions\nFor the Basement Building Management Suite:\n\nNew Internal Partitions: Construction of new internal walls in accordance with the approved refurbishment specification.\n\nNon-Invasive Structural Intersections: Designing the new partitions to \"dog-leg\" around existing original steel columns and structural supports instead of fixing directly to them, ensuring no interventions to the original steelwork.\n\nFor the Ground Floor Business Lounge and Meeting Suite:\n\nNon-Permanent Fit-Out: Installation of loose furniture and feature pendant lighting.\n\nFree-Standing Coffee Bar: Installation of a coffee bar that requires a small penetration through the existing floor slab for water supply and drainage connections (to be concealed entirely beneath the bar).\n\nFuture Reinstatement Plan: Utilising a supply of reclaimed original parquet flooring to repair and reinstate the floor if the coffee bar is removed in the future.",
